<br>&nbsp;<br>When we started Freedom Farms, our family farm, the mission was simple: <strong><span style="color: rgb(74, 144, 226);">SAVE AMERICAN FARMS</span></strong> and help families nationwide get access to delicious meats from animals born, raised, and processed in the USA.
<br><br>We were tired of seeing American families being fed lower-quality grocery store meats that are both poor quality and imported. While also watching real farms in <strong>America </strong>— run by hard working families disappear.
<br><br>Every year, more small farms shut down. And more control shifts to massive corporations and foreign entities purchasing American farms.
<br><br>The connection between families and their food is being lost.
<br><br>We refused to let that happen quietly.
