at service!!!"</span></p></div></div></div>{% endform %}{% endif %}{% assign product = defaultProduct %}</div><div data-pf-type="Custom.HTML" class="sc-eXrZXP dUozjE pf-225_"><script>
let userPaused = new WeakSet();
let userMuted = new WeakSet();

document.querySelectorAll('.pf-media-wrapper video').forEach(video => {

  video.setAttribute('playsinline', '');
  video.muted = true; // autoplay ke liye start muted

  video.play().catch(()=>{});

  // Track pause
  video.addEventListener('pause', () => {
    if (video.closest('.pf-slide-main-media.is-current')) {
      userPaused.add(video);
    }
  });

  video.addEventListener('play', () => {
    userPaused.delete(video);
  });

  // Track mute/unmute via controls
  video.addEventListener('volumechange', () => {
    if (video.muted) {
      userMuted.add(video);
    } else {
      userMuted.delete(video);
    }
  });

});

setInterval(() => {
  document.querySelectorAll('.pf-media-wrapper video').forEach(video => {

    let isActive = video.closest('.pf-slide-main-media.is-current');

    if (isActive) {

      // ▶️ Play if needed
      if (!userPaused.has(video) && video.paused) {
        video.play().catch(()=>{});
      }

      // 🔊 Unmute only if user ne mute nahi kiya
      if (!userMuted.has(video)) {
        video.muted = false;
      }

    } else {
      // ⛔ Background videos
      video.pause();
      video.muted = true;
      userPaused.delete(video);
    }

  });
}, 800); // thoda fast response
</script></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-590c" data-category="FAQs" data-name="Lovey" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-izQAGL fMRybl pf-226_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div class="sc-rPVVi iEcWc pf-flex-section"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOQUxc lfiEJ pf-227_ pf-heading-1-h3">Frequently Asked Questions</h3><p class="sc-erUUlO dcvJTZ pf-229_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Have a Question? We’ve Got the Answer!</p><div class="sc-fThTNe fPYOGZ pf-231_ pf-icon-right" data-scroll-to-top="true" data-open-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3"><details class="sc-SrAaV fTsMaP pf-232_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-bdOgOc hZBVbi pf-233_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="771a73b1-6bec-440c-afe2-c7f52a963b1f" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Where does your meat come from?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-empmoP ka-dQLX pf-235_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-fEcCUj fUpLAN pf-236_"><p class="sc-erUUlO dcvJTZ pf-237_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">All of our beef, pork, and chicken are raised right here in the USA. We partner with trusted American farms that share our commitment to quality, animal welfare, and clean food.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-SrAaV fTsMaP pf-239_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-bdOgOc hZBVbi pf-240_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="0c6fe2c7-f52a-463b-9fe8-666f47a2b22b" data-active