253_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-bdOgOc hZBVbi pf-254_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="b22bb8f7-728e-4d02-b37b-892ede026f5e" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>How is your meat shipped?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-empmoP ka-dQLX pf-256_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-fEcCUj fUpLAN pf-257_"><p class="sc-erUUlO dcvJTZ pf-258_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We ship frozen meat nationwide in insulated packaging with dry ice designed to keep your order cold during transit.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-SrAaV fTsMaP pf-260_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-bdOgOc hZBVbi pf-261_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="02737b89-2ede-426f-9e6c-5e2466bd1206" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>How long will the meat stay fresh?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-empmoP ka-dQLX pf-263_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-fEcCUj fUpLAN pf-264_"><p class="sc-erUUlO dcvJTZ pf-265_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Our meat is vacuum-sealed and frozen for maximum freshness. Most products can be stored in the freezer for up to 12 months.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-SrAaV fTsMaP pf-267_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-bdOgOc hZBVbi pf-268_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="6f5e6c5e-2466-4d12-86f2-936e7cb9dcf8" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Do I need a subscription?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-empmoP ka-dQLX pf-270_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-fEcCUj fUpLAN pf-271_"><p class="sc-erUUlO dcvJTZ pf-272_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">No. You can order whenever you’d like. We also offer optional subscription programs for customers who want regular deliveries and savings.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-SrAaV fTsMaP pf-274_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-bdOgOc hZBVbi pf-275_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="1206f293-6e7c-49dc-b877-a96e37cd7a0a" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><spa